  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waterways investment for the development of the environment in Lagos-State (OMI EKO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project consist of two components. Component 1 include the detailed engineering design, construction and supervision of 15 ferry routes and Inland Waterways Transport (IWT) infrastructures comprising of 25 ferry terminals and jetties.12 of the terminals will be equipped with electrical production and charging stations, 2 with light maintenance facilities and inter-modal facilities. Component 2 comprises the design and procurement of 78 electric-powered vessels and intelligent transport systems (ITS) including supply, operations and maintenance of the ITS equipment, terminals, jetties and control centre.. This component also includes institutional strengthening and capacity building of .the implementing agency Lagos State Waterways Agency (LASWA)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
